cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SKAVA, please cite it as below."
title: "SKAVA: federated data discovery with compute-next-to-data routing"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/VisIVOLab/SKAVA"
url: "https://skava.readthedocs.io"
abstract: >-
  SKAVA is the data discovery and access service of the SKA Visual Analytics
  project for the SKA Regional Centre network. A scientific query resolves to
  a dataset, the dataset to its replicas across the federation's nodes, and a
  ranking policy over the nodes' measured state picks the replica and the
  compute service next to it, with the reason, in a standard DataLink response.
keywords:
  - Virtual Observatory
  - SKA Regional Centres
  - data discovery
  - DataLink
  - compute next to data
